        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Reaction of 3,5-di-tert-butyl-o-benzoquinone with ethanolamine, LnCl3·6H2O, and CuCl2·2H2O at room temperature under aerobic conditions in a 2:2:1:2 ratio in the presence of Et3N affords blue-turquoise needlelike crystals of isomorphic [Ln4Cu8L8(μ2-H2O)(μ3-OH)8Cl10(H2O)4]Cl2·6MeCN (Ln = Dy, 1). Full experimental amounts are indicated to reside in SI, which was not supplied.",
